1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,440
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,440
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:54,557
(Lu Zhentian)

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,840
=Episode 2=

18
00:01:21,787 --> 00:01:23,080
(Weren't you supposed to silence her?)

19
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,840
(Why did you bring her back?)

20
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,480
(From now on,)

21
00:01:27,719 --> 00:01:29,120
(she's on our side.)

22
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:31,959
(Can she pull it off?)

23
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,239
(When have I ever misjudged anyone?)

24
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:43,920
Butler Zhou.

25
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,159
Begin the ancestral rite.

26
00:01:45,159 --> 00:01:46,680
Congratulations, Governor.

27
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,239
Your long-lost pearl has returned.

28
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:55,599
(Ancestral rite.)

29
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,959
(With our ancestors as witness,)

30
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:59,840
(and our clan elders gathered here,)

31
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:02,640
(a long-lost descendant of the Lu clan)

32
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,599
(has finally returned.)

33
00:02:04,719 --> 00:02:06,400
(With our ancestors' blessing,)

34
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,760
(this is a joyous day for our family.)

35
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:09,840
(Ms. Lu.)

36
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,840
(You still haven't told me the mission.)

37
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,159
(The Lu family has a family heirloom.)

38
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,520
(Your mission is to become
the person Lu Zhentian is closest to)

39
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,639
(Lu Yutang)
(and trusts most in this world.)

40
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:20,840
(Make him willingly
pass the family heirloom on to you.)

41
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,360
(Lu Zhentian has a son.)

42
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,560
(Why pass it on to a daughter?)

43
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:24,840
(He has no son.)

44
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,520
(Lin Kefu was Lu Zhentian's only child.)

45
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,759
(Adjutant He, that's
where you're wrong.)

46
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:32,439
(You should say)

47
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:35,639
(I'm supposed to be Lu Zhentian's
only child.)

48
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:39,120
(Save your wit and clever tricks
for the mission.)

49
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,800
(Lu Zhentian is vicious, ruthless)

50
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,039
(Lu Yutang | Lu Yuran)
(and deeply calculating.)

51
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:44,159
(You won't fool him with petty tricks.)

52
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,520
(You still haven't told me)

53
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,120
(what exactly
the Lu family heirloom is.)

54
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,800
(Lu Yutang)
(A treasure map.)

55
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:51,599
(It leads to gold bars worth
a city's fortune.)

56
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:53,319
(Lu Yutang of the Lu Clan of Fancheng)

57
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:56,919
(hereby rejoins the family.)

58
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:57,837
(Loyalty Eternal)

59
00:02:57,837 --> 00:03:02,337
♪That familiar wicked streak♪

60
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,759
Father, please have some tea.

61
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,520
My girl.

62
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,759
Get up.

63
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:14,840
Thank you, Father.

64
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,719
Where's Shaoyun?

65
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,520
Here I am.

66
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,520
It's just a daughter.

67
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,199
Incense, tea, all this ceremony.

68
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:25,240
Is all this really necessary?

69
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,479
Kefu.

70
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:36,639
Who did this to you?

71
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:40,360
Lu Shaoyun is the killer.

72
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:44,120
(I never thought I'd face my enemy)

73
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:46,080
(so soon.)

74
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:49,400
(He's lecherous. Perfect.)

75
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:52,280
(My enemy's lust gives me an opening.)

76
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:56,000
So you really are my sister?

77
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,240
Did you check everything?

78
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,439
She'd better not be an impostor.

79
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:02,960
Remember.

80
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:05,719
You should resist accepting
this new sister

81
00:04:05,719 --> 00:04:06,800
who appeared out of nowhere.

82
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,479
Got it.

83
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,360
Quit fooling around.

84
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,240
Sit down.

85
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,719
I'm just joking, Father.

86
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:19,319
My girl, serve your brother some tea.

87
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:20,680
All right.

88
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,160
Brother, please have some tea.

89
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:51,439
Brother, I'm sorry.

90
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,399
Father.

91
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,000
My sister is too reckless.

92
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,360
Looks like she needs some discipline.

93
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:00,560
Is that any way to talk to your sister?

94
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,759
I keep telling you to read more.

95
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,040
You're so uncultured.

96
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:06,639
Enough.

97
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,920
Tonight,

98
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:11,319
let's have a family reunion dinner.

99
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:19,360
Having a powerful father is pretty nice.

100
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:27,680
Both bags look great.

101
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:28,839
I like them both.

102
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,720
You may go.

103
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:34,680
- Yes.
- Yes.

104
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,279
This dress is the prettiest.

105
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:51,079
I'll wear it when I see Father tonight.

106
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,600
What do you think, Adjutant He?

107
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,319
Nothing special.

108
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:59,040
As long as I like it.

109
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:06,160
(Afraid to die.)

110
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,720
(Vain.)

111
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,000
(Fawning.)

112
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,240
(Someone like her makes)

113
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,480
(the perfect pawn.)

114
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,160
(Even without He Jingchen's mission,)

115
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,759
(to stay at the Governor's Residence,)

116
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,399
(I'd still have to win
Lu Zhentian over.)

117
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:36,439
(What kind of daughter would he like?)

118
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:53,720
Even as the young lady of
the Governor's Residence,

119
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:56,759
you should knock before entering
someone else's room.

120
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,199
I came to borrow something from you.

121
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:10,720
What?

122
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,680
Why do you need the military uniform
I wore as a child?

123
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,560
For a magic trick.

124
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,160
Weren't you the one who promised
to give me your full support?

125
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,879
Your sister will be here soon.

126
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:11,079
Act like a proper brother.

127
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,240
Lu Yutang of the Lu Army,

128
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,639
reporting for duty.

129
00:08:17,639 --> 00:08:18,680
You little rascal.

130
00:08:18,879 --> 00:08:20,879
You look quite the part.

131
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:21,079
Come.

132
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:21,480
Sit.

133
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,600
Father.

134
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,920
Though I didn't grow up by your side,

135
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:30,079
your reputation is legendary.

136
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:32,360
You're the person I admire most
in all of Fancheng.

137
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,559
Speaking of which,

138
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:37,799
I had a roomful of Western dresses
prepared for you.

139
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,159
Where did that uniform come from?

140
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:47,960
I conjured it up.

141
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:52,200
I'm your daughter.

142
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:53,759
Of course I want to be like you

143
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:55,559
and become Fancheng's guardian deity.

144
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,600
Good.

145
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,360
Pour the wine.

146
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,360
Have a drink with me.

147
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,120
Come.

148
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,919
Let's drink as a family.

149
00:09:04,387 --> 00:09:05,440
- Come on.
- Cheers.

150
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,240
Quite the old drunk.

151
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:12,159
He's met his match in the little one.

152
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:16,759
I'm going back to the study.

153
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:17,879
Keep an eye on things in there.

154
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,600
Another round!

155
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:20,840
Father, you can really hold your liquor!

156
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,480
Father.

157
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,799
Let me toast you again.

158
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:28,279
All right.

159
00:09:28,279 --> 00:09:30,000
Tonight, we drink till we drop.

160
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,480
I'm so hot.

161
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,480
Easy now.

162
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,960
I'll take you back to your room.

163
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,679
Brother.

164
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,679
I like hearing that.

165
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,240
Say it again.

166
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:13,559
Brother.

167
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,120
(Kefu,)

168
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,879
(tonight,)

169
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,639
(I'll send your killer to you
to atone for what he did.)

170
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,000
(One Day Earlier)

171
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,925
(I don't even know my own birthday.)

172
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:50,320
(Just so we could share a birthday,)

173
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:53,159
(I insisted we had the exact same
date of birth.)

174
00:10:55,039 --> 00:10:55,919
(Kefu,)

175
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,360
(we're finally eighteen.)

176
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,799
(We're adults now.)

177
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,240
(I never thought)

178
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:08,320
(death would part us so soon.)

179
00:11:09,279 --> 00:11:10,759
(Kefu,)

180
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:12,240
(forgive me)

181
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:14,080
(for borrowing your identity)

182
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:15,320
(to avenge you.)

183
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,910
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

184
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:39,320
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

185
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,970
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

186
00:11:43,470 --> 00:11:45,050
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

187
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:49,170
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

188
00:11:49,710 --> 00:11:55,120
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

189
00:11:56,710 --> 00:12:00,050
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

190
00:12:00,050 --> 00:12:03,400
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

191
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:05,960
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

192
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:08,960
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

193
00:12:09,230 --> 00:12:15,480
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

194
00:12:15,970 --> 00:12:19,300
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

195
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:22,530
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

196
00:12:22,530 --> 00:12:29,300
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

197
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:32,550
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

198
00:12:32,550 --> 00:12:35,990
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

199
00:12:35,990 --> 00:12:38,130
♪Boundless♪
